### Admin Users API - Date Range Filtering Examples

### Get doctors registered between specific dates
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/admin/users?userType=doctor&fromDate=2024-01-01&toDate=2024-12-31

### Get patients registered after a specific date (backwards compatible)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/admin/users?userType=patient&createdAt=2024-01-01

### Get doctors registered after a specific date (backwards compatible)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/admin/users?userType=doctor&createdAt=2024-01-01

### Get users with date range AND other filters
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/admin/users?userType=doctor&fromDate=2024-01-01&toDate=2024-12-31&specialization=Cardiology&page=1&limit=10

### Get patients with date range AND other filters
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/admin/users?userType=patient&fromDate=2024-01-01&toDate=2024-12-31&bloodGroup=A+&firstname=John

### Get doctors with fromDate only (created after this date)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/admin/users?userType=doctor&fromDate=2024-06-01

### Get patients with toDate only (created before this date)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/admin/users?userType=patient&toDate=2024-12-31

### Pagination with date range filtering
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/admin/users?userType=doctor&fromDate=2024-01-01&toDate=2024-12-31&page=2&limit=5

### Sorting with date range filtering
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/admin/users?userType=patient&fromDate=2024-01-01&toDate=2024-12-31&sort=firstName

### Combined filtering: date range + name + email + pagination
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/admin/users?userType=doctor&fromDate=2024-01-01&toDate=2024-12-31&firstname=John&email=john@example.com&page=1&limit=10